# The buttons of a tutorial note (see tutwin.c): a note with Continue and End Tour (mode 2) at the left and (mode 3) at the right of the
# screen: hover over each, click Continue, click End Tour. A click takes the note down through the window's button handler (which
# keeps the button's id in the object, clears the answer for the ones that end the tour, and notes the answered note's bits).
25 load
26 state tw_fields 0x8cc1e4 0x5c
26 state tw_flags 0x8cc244 8
26 state tw_button 0x8cc224 8
26 state tw_seen 0x9a64ac 0x14
26 state tw_ans 0x9a64b8 8
44 open tut_terrain_m2
50 snap open
52 move 172 736
56 snap hover-continue
58 move 475 736
62 snap hover-end
64 click 172 736          # Continue
68 snap continue
70 open tut_terrain_m2
76 snap open-again
78 click 475 736          # End Tour
82 snap end-tour
84 open tut_terrain_m3
90 snap right
92 click 546 736          # Continue
96 snap right-continue
98 open tut_terrain_m3
104 snap right-again
106 click 849 736         # End Tour
110 snap right-end
112 close
